{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/transition-placement-and-hold-walk",
  "seed": "A transition that needs an overlap can sit before the cut, across it or after it, and a dip can hold on black. At a cut where only one side has spare, a cross dissolve goes after the cut. A hold inserts real time and undo takes it out. At Next defaults, no flag set.",
